  "name": "MedVidBench",
  "alternateName": [
    "Medical Video Understanding Benchmark"
  ],
  "description": "Large-scale benchmark for heterogeneous medical and surgical video understanding, comprising 531,850 video-instruction pairs assembled from 8 source datasets (AVOS, CholecT50, CholecTrack20, Cholec80-CVS, CoPESD, EgoSurgery, JIGSAWS, NurViD) and spanning video-, segment-, and frame-level tasks: temporal action localization, spatiotemporal grounding, video summarization, region captioning, and surgical skill / Critical View of Safety (CVS) assessment. Released alongside the MedGRPO model by Northeastern University and United Imaging Intelligence (CVPR 2026). The public Hugging Face distribution provides a ~18 GB archive (103,742 video frames; 6,245 test samples across 8 surgical-video tasks) downloadable as ZIP or via Git LFS. Licensed CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0; individual source datasets retain their own upstream licences and must be complied with separately.",
  "url": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/UII-AI/MedVidBench",
